11
01:11:30,000 --> 01:11:36,000
A Little Chaos is a 2014 British period drama film directed by Alan Rickman, based on a story
conceived by Alison Deegan, who co-wrote the screenplay with Rickman and Jeremy Brock.

12
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
It stars Kate Winslet, Matthias Schoenaerts, Rickman, Stanley Tucci, Helen
McCrory, Steven Waddington, Jennifer Ehle and Rupert Penry-Jones.

13
01:24:30,000 --> 01:24:36,000
It was financed by Lionsgate UK and produced by BBC Films.

14
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:06,000
The second film directed by Rickman, after his 1997 debut The Winter Guest, and the last before his death in 2016, it
was also the second collaboration of Rickman and Winslet after their 1995 film Sense and Sensibility.

15
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
Production took place in London in mid-2013, and it premiered as the closing night film
at the 2014 Toronto International Film Festival on 13 September 2014.

16
01:44:00,000 --> 01:44:06,000
The film explores themes of adultery, infidelity,
jealousy, france, paris, france.

17
01:50:30,000 --> 01:50:36,000
The tone is emotional.
